X:1
T:Rusi Kosi Imam
O:Bulgaria (Pirin)
N:Bulgarian folk dance song from the Pirin region, from the mu-tech.org WorldTrad setting (melody MIDI diffed note by note; chords read from its lead sheet and accompaniment). Source is in E minor; moved down a whole tone to D minor to fit C4-A5. Source note values are written at twice their length (sixteenths as eighths), so each bar here is half a bar of the source.
M:4/4
Q:1/4=120
L:1/8
